Package: calcbloc
Type: Package
Title: Income Tax Brackets and Social Security Rates from Official Sources
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Binu", "Mathew", email = "binumathew1988@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("itmarkerz technologies", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Tidy data frames of income tax brackets, social security
    contribution rates, thresholds and allowances for more than 30
    countries, with the official source, retrieval date and verification
    status on every row. National tables for the current tax year ship with
    the package and work offline; regional tables (US states, Canadian
    provinces, Spanish and Italian regions, Swiss cantons and others) and the
    latest revisions can be fetched from the 'CalcBloc' public API
    <https://calcbloc.com/developers>, which also returns take-home pay and
    employer cost calculations. Includes vectorised helpers that apply a
    progressive band schedule to incomes. The bundled data come from
    <https://calcbloc.com/data> and are licensed CC BY 4.0.
